<body>
    <h1>addUser</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h3 id=3D"addUser-Method:POST"><strong>Method: POST</strong></h3>
<p class=3D"p1"><strong> URI :&nbsp;/msapi/idgraph/idgraphusermanagementms/=
v1/user/add</strong></p>
<h3 id=3D"addUser-Description"><strong>Description</strong></h3>
<p>This operation is used to create new accessId for retail, online and ind=
irect partner flows. This API takes profile information like FN, LN, contac=
tEmail, password, security Q/A etc in request, does the accessId availabili=
ty check internally and creates the accessId and send the accessId informat=
ion to downstream applications like HaloC, CCR, and CG</p>
